# PDK-refresh pilot (2026-07-17): 3 small modules x 5 nodes, one relaxed
# clock each, to shake out new-library errors before the full sweep.
#   - intadd  : plain module (single 'random' stimulus class)
#   - fpmac   : FP datapath + 4 activity modes (random/hold_b/sparse50/idle)
#   - regfile : sequential + 4 modes (random/read/write/idle) -> exercises
#               the QA identity P(read)+P(write)-P(idle) ~= P(random)
# Clocks = 3 x OLD-pdk T_min, ceiled to the 0.25 ns grid (floor 0.5 ns):
# generous margin because the new 51-cell libraries have not been probed yet.
# Usage: cp jobs_pilot jobs && ./run_batch.py rtl && ./run_batch.py sweep
